# Permanent 301 Redirect Rules (Compatible with Cloudflare Pages & Netlify)
# Enforce single canonical HTTPS apex domain: https://smaranraut.com.np/

# 1. 301 Redirect previous netlify.app domain to custom domain (preserving paths and query parameters)
https://smaran-seo.netlify.app/*  https://smaranraut.com.np/:splat  301
http://smaran-seo.netlify.app/*   https://smaranraut.com.np/:splat  301

# 2. 301 Redirect HTTP to HTTPS on custom domain
http://smaranraut.com.np/*        https://smaranraut.com.np/:splat  301

# 3. 301 Redirect WWW to non-WWW apex domain
https://www.smaranraut.com.np/*   https://smaranraut.com.np/:splat  301
http://www.smaranraut.com.np/*    https://smaranraut.com.np/:splat  301
